  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For parallel combination, current divides in the inverse ratio of resistance.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>.</p>",
